cast to play siblings on television. After all, that's the best way to make it seem like the relationship is an authentic one. In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d66\"},\"ref\":\"d66\",\"snippet\":\" ... would be unrelated to the Veronica Mars series.\\n\\nFollowing the cancellation of Veronica Mars, Bell voiced interest in appearing on Heroes because she was a fan. On July 29, 2007, during a train ride back to Los Angeles from San Diego Comic-Con with Heroes actors Zachary Quinto ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kristen_Bell\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d67\"},\"ref\":\"d67\",\"snippet\":\" ... child or spouse, but sometimes it can also be a sibling. If the person is a male sibling, or unmarried female sibling, you could be in luck.\\n\\nAs with the tip above, this is only a clue. Remember that this person could be completely unrelated, or the surname ... \",\"title\":\"https://familyhistorydaily.com/genealogy-help-and-how-to/7-little-used-tricks-for-finding-that-missing-maiden-name/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d68\"},\"ref\":\"d68\",\"snippet\":\" ... He moved on with Homicide: Life on the Street costar Isabella Hoffman. The pair, who dated from the mid-90s to early '00s, share son Atticus, born in 1996.\\n\\nIreland Baldwin Shares Throwback Photo With Dad Alec After His Manslaughter Trial Is Dismissed\\n\\nThe actor married Joanne Baldwin ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/meet-baldwin-family-guide-brothers-171301996.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d69\"},\"ref\":\"d69\",\"snippet\":\" ... Labour Force Survey from the Office for National Statistics\\n\\nNotes:\\n\\n- One-family households include households with one family and other individuals (related or unrelated), e.g., a married couple living with a lodger.\\n\\nDownload this chart Figure 3: The majority (97%) of households are either one family or ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.ons.gov.uk/peoplepopulationandcommunity/birthsdeathsandmarriages/families/bulletins/familiesandhouseholds/2022\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d70\"},\"ref\":\"d70\",\"snippet\":\" ... versions of real-life actors.\\n\\nYouTube.com\\n\\n61. Cow and Chicken\\n\\nFeaturing the adventures of two siblings who often run into The Red Guy, who tries to scam them while wearing various disguises.\\n\\nThe show was unique in that one voice actor filled all three main roles in ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cleveland.com/entertainment/2017/07/60_years_of_hanna-barbera_cart.html\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"a7aa0d2d4c66858d484e4199019d469ed47158c84eec5d28b66949fb3ad4bac7\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"1602e049a5fbd569cc7779421dca9f276b98370cbbd8eab3c39bb3bd775f1dbe\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"actor plays with real life spouse sibling unrelated characters series married three times\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_cc3d066b31b640539d2c450b"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d71\"},\"ref\":\"d71\",\"snippet\":\" ... Or, should I say the character who appears in the title? Either way, it's Yellowstone and every one knows it! No more parks masquerading as alien worlds.\\n\\nWhere Did Costner Draw His Inspiration?\\n\\nAccording to Kieran Fisher, Costner drew inspiration from the numerous real-life ranchers who ... \",\"title\":\"https://morethanjustparks.com/national-park-tv-shows/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d72\"},\"ref\":\"d72\",\"snippet\":\" ... Since creating Yellowstone, Sheridan has created seven more shows, including 1883 and 1923, prequels to Yellowstone that follow previous generations of the Dutton family. In Sheridan's widespread television universe, he does not shy away from maximizing the acting talent in his shows, and often casts the same ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/taylor-sheridan-actors-multiple-shows-ranked/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d73\"},\"ref\":\"d73\",\"snippet\":\" ... Smith about his real-life rodeo experiences and comment on Jamie's transformation in Season 3.\\n\\n- 11m 50s\\n\\n- 06/22/2020\\n\\n1923: Behind the Story\\n\\n- Behind the Story - A Dream and a MemoryThe cast discusses Alex and Spencer's reunion, the shootout at the Livingston train station, the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.paramountnetwork.com/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d74\"},\"ref\":\"d74\",\"snippet\":\" ... 1883 attempting to raise another generation of Dutton.\\\" Yellowstone viewers will recall a flashback in season four, which introduced James and Ma