\":{\"ref\":\"d99\"},\"ref\":\"d99\",\"snippet\":\" ... The family lived in a log cabin without electricity or plumbing. He later described the setting as \\\"about 40 acres of poor cotton land, watermelons, and tobacco,\\\" a place where he trapped rabbits, ate melons, and listened to his maternal grandfather tell \\\"long and intricate\\\" stories of the ... \",\"title\":\"https://murrow.wsu.edu/about-edward-r-murrow/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d100\"},\"ref\":\"d100\",\"snippet\":\" ... A personal benefit contract is generally any life insurance, annuity, or endowment contract that benefits, directly or indirectly, the transferor, a member of the transferor's family, or any other person designated by the transferor (other than an organization described in section 170(c)).\\n\\nLine 7g.\\n\\nForm 8899 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.irs.gov/instructions/i990\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... Olyphant is excellent as Derek Browne, the patriarch of the family. He initially plays the role with the cool calmness he pulls off so well in other roles, but becomes an anxious and desperate man when things start to unravel. The series makes for a gripping noir movie ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/timothy-olyphant-best-movies-tv-shows/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"9f5aee288e2c04889afacc99fee3d2856cc78b780185891795aae94301e398e7\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"e0c5475dd0835301164adbd7234c2add93eb8c5f97eba3df7a4f7eb177ab2ab4\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"series where real life family member