\\ndrama, actress/singer Katey Sagal became a household name in the late\\n\\n1980s as the fabulously brazen, undomesticated Peg Bundy on the\\n\\nenduring Fox series\\n\\nMarried... with Children (1987).\\n\\nDuring its lengthy run she received ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/list/ls069089978/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d101\"},\"ref\":\"d101\",\"snippet\":\" ... long run on CBS\\n\\nThe beloved redhead spent 23 years as a Monday night fixture on the CBS television schedule. Ball informed the network that she would not continue on with her weekly series, \\\"Here's Lucy.\\\" The actress ended one of the longest prime‐time runs in ... \",\"title\":\"https://stacker.com/stories/tv/sitcom-history-year-you-were-born\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"4b6b7d484c05af5e0aba0331c3ef57628c089c1fdbae441f2fcd04f09c0c7e94\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"3ca468d06fdd3098e3fe87bfbe4d6a99ca2174f8ce8cdefe287492a06e85a994\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"long running series character widowed multiple times children\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_69d82ac3d4b24f35aa299768"},{"content":"Current control state (data, not source evidence):\n{\"current_notes_not_evidence\":[],\"evidence_shelf\":{\"omitted_for_capacity\":[],\"restored_exact_windows\":[],\"selection\":\"bounded recent first-delivery order; not a relevance/verification judgment\"},\"feedback\":null,\"instruction\":\"Read only useful passages. Notes and all-page cleanup are optional.\",\"literal_answer_contract\":{\"origin\":\"explicit experiment configuration, not inferred from question\",\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"\"},\"phase\":\"RESEARCH\",\"remaining\":{\"action_slots\":1